  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c80e64a3979cb4c9a8c1c707",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！　我好开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bec198bb135d43e5ecbda71434d6bf6f9d89941b225b2068dec072a393c593d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d30af4a8d2ec9e4fd89851e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef872523c3b18a11c4cdfc077f1f60c91dd68732da0c7945038772ef8edf118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed55dc6809c7da811004e5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b2e97503c0c49da0799907595a6c55dfb43301636454e613d59bec8fdc2a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ba7b4bdd9a9cd28d84bfb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟你说我跟你说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f9ae0077a790efaf7ee6015d431b4ea4f72a09142b44790976507d5a473ad9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37e445fba8b3b3a6dc7b819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗──噗──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f7db53f380305bd8c557a756a71d39a48e2266e5d6c83ff9e746376d67d244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86014ea173a225db3740af50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要不要──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84b5a2cd777679ebeca0e39255ed0172d2f359fc33099fc41d4d08f12f69285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d99dddba110d4997f0a7f51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64bf59363c0e049aa39f7460c90ce8572a75f21706c84d8d30f47a888d8a316",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a7340bd5e6c99aa1e348a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……？\r\n怎么身体好像不听使唤……？\r\nMaya这是怎么了啊……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19194bd640e4c61f2561c1850cd3855df2e3e9ea6db4c23bcaa2dcfbad6b94c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:850b4ec27095bf5893ebed94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～？精神好像有种\r\n急剧下降的感觉……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a99a186db7a57c20e656104e75dd5fa30d4421442022a80b6a333da1757232f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907e1aa2d1bb7ce043276be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃料填满！已经做好离地的准备！\r\n随时都可以起飞哦！\r\n现在的我说不定真的能飞起来呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70976e953caff5a85d69682ee63498cb65346b903fe34e0a4172e72421668c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a62459c047de9b73207cc96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n你不觉得现在的Maya\r\n看起来很耀眼吗？诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b60d557a198101b4c9447f98b0ef35504f0774855db059b7cee0d1ef2cb9edd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76a53089f442ab2b7c5fed20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯嗯！\r\n身体很轻很灵活！Maya感觉可以跑很远哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a701eb2b644a0cd8be5c146e3824844986c0bab703ed496ad5e62898d4d61b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daa9a82d768c2598fad7ceb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么样的训练都尽管来吧！\r\n我会咻～地一下就做完的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "529f11aa75b0bfcee553317ea961031b14b5e5008240eb7e5596e3ca35ed910a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a1443c109ac5153afe27d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya会努力的～！\r\n做得好要记得称赞我哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "103e002e47e47d7ddd43cd82ceaaf5e022ef46c9aaf80ba02ceb30434be529b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175bbf25f3550217a1379d3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能不能找到什么\r\n让人雀跃的事情来做呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f14a08019ced8328741aa72e2573fee215d19810dbd63b710914b393c0e4631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363da9a2a9d4208805c17590",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya会努力的，\r\n所以等下给我奖励吧？\r\n不然我好像提不起劲的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49c9807c0bb233eeb3ffe39a9961a2c1789954fa10e0a8306458d464e1ae343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce75cce1b968a1bea66935e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～真是奇怪～？\r\n没办法跑出我要的样子呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f644813966e070a70ec205d50a36602400abacfe4d7a7de6ebbcf87013ab29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd1e141437a17af8b2dcbe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……好像状态不太好的感觉。\r\nMaya快要坠机了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c4ce799d748be5219c5fb526b319c37e0233049fb63077b2bae8c617995af45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a817dc5c972f39c3e14946c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在不想要努力了啦！\r\n不管谁来说什么！\r\n不想做的事情就是不想做──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a708f0780951a89f13f36f57a3483467387ef28944995878a96d9918a27d91f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39988e65624a5a467549d0e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近参加太多比赛了吧？\r\n如果你是有什么计划的话，\r\nMaya是愿意努力的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9837df2e9e9cc7639c82b1e3d4cf6da56cf96a91fd9a34cd4c6421103112019e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66dc3280e672473ff4ef7d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要参赛……？\r\n虽然我很喜欢比赛……\r\n但脚已经重到没办法好好跑了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ae0e49ea9a5cfb4d216d1d79f2ebce19417d8c90e832411f2e754a7f1d084d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fb9008b6d35580b6dd5c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于要正式比赛了！\r\n感觉能开心地跑完这场比赛呢！\r\n我好期待哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c26b35afd11e072f6f9d4f2c1141b0970fb987aa19321d25573db781422c51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97f0311083b70ab2c5cf945a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你要看好哦！\r\nMaya会跑出史上最棒的成绩的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ab335cb7e8d1b81009b6605dd549b73d5f251c568161ef37472eaf77d17632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c3224df5f19dfb3a26d90d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的Maya感觉用\r\n任何跑法都能跑第一哦！\r\n好期待赶快开始啊～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "76dfee143f1721e37d03b0070516635d06a89a46854acf7dd36d4b746746e15a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e81743fe3a04c42ef333859f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向胜利，Maya的状态不断上升中哦！\r\n感觉能有非常耀眼的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3089b01f444d7386dbb340b0e13828101a632dbab2cce37504f3ba44e46fb4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b243cf56b397ff70fd51367d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很重要的比赛对吧！\r\n已经开始感到期待了──！\r\nMaya会努力的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb33d42c54f36a6a891a522df25185981d25255422dbc4b6ed935d5589ddcb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:204cdeeb3d61ce526247b410",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要怎么跑才好呢～？\r\n训练员觉得怎么跑会最开心呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c733785ff1504d6e82764eaa9870c85e3dd8c31a9fdd43819b59ce301d513d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2ae552dce6d5b8ed22a231",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用全力咻～地奔跑！\r\n那我去享受奔跑的乐趣咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "790ee2012bf92d22d5eb3c5e967e3d390d65d35530225c99904d9c3a86fed3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d0352fe4082192abf60335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们目标的比赛呢！\r\n不知道会对上哪些人！真期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e19a07b7f59eed17fe6bf693dfa54151239f1c1046c9b7a9c3ead01dbb0f4eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb4831b6a269c35c2c03f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题，我知道的！\r\n只要像平常一样去跑就好了，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a562da67c37c42dcaf2977180288de98aec01da86f914a05105cf1912fdd1453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:686ff84fa4cfb87bc6e7400f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心！\r\nMaya常常突然就状态转好的！\r\n所以稍微的状态不好也没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b285f6ee164aa4aefc906542b5b982ea78910d57c9acc63dd347b2fc7eba0dde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476d006de5fad3cc4d7205ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会尽全力去跑的！\r\n不能白费一直以来的努力嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec2ef71f44d8414a55f48080ccabae12b9ec87700aa9c30ef9718839444874c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9f3d7da6e16555cbf46e3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉没像平常那样充满期待呢……\r\n但只要跑起来应该就没问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25fede6a4fb99655785748aefd50b4c3fccef786df8c284d5a22f1822a9fa03b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbf2e3022087b75ef11f74f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……！\r\n你要为Maya加油哦……！一定要哦！\r\n这样我就一定可以很努力跑的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "704d5afedc44490d6ac88d5b745c35563e9e7f383cbccc422b2b769be370dd96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744b034c404f5460a2f1b6bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有点搞不清楚该怎么去跑了……\r\n但这样反而好像更让我期待了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a3ddc44664709a7c1d15cf88be871996cc7b29ada2f6c3e59cc1b4c1be694e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3bf19b9c8c1c016f4e79f81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得成熟的女人\r\n就是在各种情况下都能很耀眼！\r\n所以Maya会努力看看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdfe2bd594269ff3cfac8b0ba710ef4d041e0ba438bc0fdbfb35ca5e9889168",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb08019615360f8ce7d76c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I Copy☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "017b691d67ce00b8be1f01960667e72be1d21c5e10d9c12e18f41072c2fb9d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907d57f8fd65227d96604533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要看好我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70dcf4ffc26dc17cb678d953b24c1d8507b3c0868ae6445254bb47757e4cb28f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f38b77f0195fb4b440fb256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2a2ce423e0b297fc818e8169f4c42f597498205d359d90c942e499cf720ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d277f5b104f9776d4a9d466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会很快就跑完的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceca6be47adecadf1bac033ed6f58d4a357dad8060009803b19ee58cc706176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9b64515045d0d5d7433db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af0450851a149f2b4b0ee2636c86f9c254fc19af1cd01c150190a2928a46b814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53759daa542b042476dbc2c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我好像腻了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "75a00fa87fb0bfd495b6839bcb3b6933723fe1b712a349a0fe82743f2e68fbe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affc45fbc7a0f2e2fe2c1968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是约会呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f778372a160aa532cea38bb0a0592e914ac7a8442bf13033d8345640ab82952",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e53688a80c74d02d6063be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，在海边约会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a58b2d65a6ad0e659c020696886013709a83772997cecc9265a30760dab0743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07433f1fba64f9d484072615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya很努力哦！快称赞我、快称赞我～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "509db99144618ee3d1df0e9fd3443fb9463b4fa0038f3fff00f896e886fe5891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
