      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a962b8fb4ca98f3fe076bba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要怎么跑才好呢～？\r\n训练员觉得怎么跑会最开心呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c733785ff1504d6e82764eaa9870c85e3dd8c31a9fdd43819b59ce301d513d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6087b0efe313d382142815cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya觉得现在用任何跑法都能跑第一！\r\n好期待赶快开始哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "758566824bfc7e16d47e6def725c3f8fc8f82fc97a0f0f1e5f6ae608cb9da531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bc3b1ea9f2dcf675fb23fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6d1884f8b49beabd7ff4aee14f1d2e98b894127e43a34dc0421276642f556e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da639c14bce068b0e28beda2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00635fd6c2ac1840065e2ed7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜啊～！下次我一定会拿第一的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bf694a6b46bcfa3cb4a91a612df8d487f42bb77e61aace7e0a7045c51880511",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b8765f5b27be97584ebd6ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还以为会成功的来着……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "638fe9e514e0324e8b029b4fd4cf6f797abd3774c37bba7c93b3b27116a43261",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546e7baba3a21446dd0b7885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……！这跟我想的不一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8273d183d34ebbf8385e4e30e7c70ec036ccf70589640af9602eb05a061a12cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8776fbd333da746ba5fec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪……？到底是怎么了呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2bd871e676e0a7e6cc42bc5fae1dff483cebaebc89f4fd6d81ab1e7b0f09e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e76bf4489fa440464cdd7cb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着陆成功……的飞吻♪Maya大获全胜☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bea36e70168f21016e1760c60e82c214f1028de75294623c45638ecf9339e405",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e5f96842896abc4e6aaaad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了☆有没有为Maya着迷呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6a364acfcb6be9d9f1489c7d48503a6f294910746edc67a58b752b7b6c5267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2fed3c20f57efab9adb5407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心跳好快……♪\r\n我心里的钟声一直响不停呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5994ad68c3c75882a05b91c852c3f4093b2db241351a4dfbbab489e78ee9ee61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea025ff5aeabf9007cf60ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了☆有没有为Maya着迷呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6a364acfcb6be9d9f1489c7d48503a6f294910746edc67a58b752b7b6c5267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2a5168c18814120e3c3363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喵喵~！来试着抓住Maya吧喵♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a529378b520aeffe554ac6cb2ed610c51dd4bb8d35589cfb550efffb05c59bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a0b54d1b6e3aff0cd0da15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Victory☆有被Maya迷住吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdedd08ee243d45b53ab90ace5572cb973b2018c3525f9311f5394674ae04301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426ec6690218ba71fbddac79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Take Off☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5790d5f60134ce63e6054514795a91b5b0686804c7b170c1a8a54e1c6a787cd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9dbf33f21dfb14e04900c56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔～我搞懂了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "78153e29da59e19dee10912b7b04c4d234612dc4d2b73db7cb49be4d83ff4c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92a7c7b084626106b12c26a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像婚纱的决胜服啊──\r\n还是性感一点的比较好吧♪\r\n就走成熟女人的路线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75539de5bb49c1877657d6b596515fa939d793627f7f925a21e2c7ab133205c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c384a0c0ce74085b8e93119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道Beauty的姐姐\r\n是怎样的人呢？好像在\r\n保健室看过长得很像的人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d90eed9b4c590e9d05f28c5a2b152424e2d763deef23ebe598bf8ad8e7305c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315a3187a06d5c66c4b10537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟Mabe亲在一起时，都预料不到\r\n会发生什么事，真是好～玩☆\r\n感觉会是个开心的圣诞节呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76dcb3b937d876a127675f1436b30bfad9e8e24190d34ddae8985006f25a50a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d775b2699da6797177e63e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我的答案，小曙！\r\n我绝对不会让自己感到后悔的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd538abb82ef2fb93598c84683349719700408eab905b956399b657ef270933",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e328ac1ca32a50286827d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是婚纱还是小曙，\r\n我两边都不想放弃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb24e7994d619765c136194b2031ab04b62e13b6117d2b109cbcbedd6c1cec6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06122dc16ff88ce7d799221c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小栗绝对没问题！\r\n人家也开始为下次的\r\n开心事做准备好了～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1fc205744400a2183639f79cc76e473ee1beb674cee7fdd9f6571c6673bd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe7c2a804279c3fd76ed9dc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿♪\r\n我有比较接近成熟的女人了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "142e56102f9257ca54a1e4ac7d9a04b4101c5e1bead79cff5a5f1d2ae6a6e83e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8d261369a68f32f38f2a96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔～我搞懂了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "78153e29da59e19dee10912b7b04c4d234612dc4d2b73db7cb49be4d83ff4c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27d610792fd687f923e8713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐──呐──！\r\n大家一起拍照留作纪念吧♪\r\nBeauty小姐也一起，快来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7dde7843501b6da0af8b723d071ff28c9f22d9edc8033b53a077a4bc936108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa01de30a701861102a6bdc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然变成有趣的一天了呢♪\r\n重炮圣诞老人不会输喔☆\r\n现在就前往闪闪发亮的天空，起飞咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4624b39805578bfd80d647dc913dc797bc2ec648ade7f42b2dc4d4b528cc8d05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9291ed36c4a80dfaa3d6d93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小心追击♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a01722daa7fff2a06184c4f36842eb692e31c9cf34eda00437dfa7f68b426c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37c5dc0896af4f397cb30e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻──☆我们来一场心动的约会吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c95a0a84ad36fb9c547cb72af88e91dc2528680caa4a1eea4515073a9b8b9d51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7efbc0e0cc1b202b4f876e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "久等了～！\r\n把Maya的心意都投注在捧花里～\r\n嗯～～～～把幸福送给大家吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ef2f918142f4ce949518cf28cef63b9192ec61dfe7e40facf4f32a26abde2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223e65715f9a71ae4ace1818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有趣的风格虽然也很好啦！！\r\n但是说道乐队的话，\r\n果然还是帅气的比较好啊~……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed4fe8f0a3983754ea539512baeb57db8d2db8ebf7a406fcf53eca878546030a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "400086"
      ]
    }
  ]
